{"metadata":{"slug":[{"Plain":"Θ-n-空间"},0],"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1],"title":[{"Plain":"Θn-空间"},2],"tag":[{"Plain":"百科"},3],"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},4]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2>观念</h2>\n<p>$\\Theta_n$-空间提供了 "},{"Local":{"url":"∞-n-范畴","text":"$(\\infty,n)$-范畴"}},{"Plain":"的一种定义, 是 "},{"Local":{"url":"Segal空间","text":"Segal 空间"}},{"Plain":"的推广.</p>\n<h2>定义</h2>\n<p>$\\Theta_n$-空间是指 "},{"Local":{"url":"Joyal范畴","text":"Joyal 范畴"}},{"Plain":" $\\Theta_n$ 上满足特定条件的"},{"Local":{"url":"生象","text":"生象"}},{"Plain":"值"},{"Local":{"url":"预层","text":"预层"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n<h2>例</h2>\n<h3>$K(\\pi,n)$</h3>\n<p>设 $\\pi$ 为 Abel 群. 考虑 "},{"Local":{"url":"Segal范畴Γ","text":"$\\Gamma$-空间"}},{"Plain":"</p>\n"}]}}